==English==
{{wikipedia|Delirium tremens}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{pathology}} A [[psychosis]] of chronic [[alcoholism]], usually due to [[alcohol]] withdrawal, which can be fatal. Symptoms include sweating, tremors, terrifying [[hallucination]]s, [[insomnia]], restlessness, [[disorientation]] and anxiety.

